<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Findory | 상세보기</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/common.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/detail.css">

</head>

<body>

<header class="header">

    <div class="logo">

        <a href="/home">
            <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Findory Logo">
        </a>

    </div>

    <nav class="nav">

        <a href="/home">홈</a>
        <a href="/write">기록</a>
        <a href="/search">검색</a>
        <a href="/library">서재</a>
        <a href="/logout">로그아웃</a>

    </nav>

</header>



<main class="detail-page">

    <section class="detail-title">

        <p class="sub-title">

            Findory Detail

        </p>

        <h1>

            독서 기록 상세보기

        </h1>

    </section>



    <section class="detail-card">

        <div class="book-cover">

            <img
                src="<%= book.coverImage ? book.coverImage : '/images/default-book.png' %>"
                alt="책 표지">

        </div>



        <div class="detail-info">

            <h2>

                <%= book.title %>

            </h2>

            <h4>

                <%= book.author %>

            </h4>

            <div class="star">

                ⭐ <%= book.star %>

            </div>



            <div class="info-grid">

                <div class="info-box">

                    <strong>📚 장르</strong>

                    <span>

                        <%= book.genre %>

                    </span>

                </div>



                <div class="info-box">

                    <strong>😊 감정</strong>

                    <span>

                        <%= book.emotion %>

                    </span>

                </div>



                <div class="info-box">

                    <strong>🌤 날씨</strong>

                    <span>

                        <%= book.weather %>

                    </span>

                </div>



                <div class="info-box">

                    <strong>🕒 시간대</strong>

                    <span>

                        <%= book.time %>

                    </span>

                </div>

            </div>



            <div class="review-box">

                <h3>

                    감상평

                </h3>

                <p>

                    <%= book.review %>

                </p>

            </div>



            <div class="button-group">

                <button
                    class="edit-btn"
                    onclick="location.href='/edit/<%= index %>'">

                    수정하기

                </button>

                <button
                    class="delete-btn"
                    data-index="<%= index %>">

                    삭제하기

                </button>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

</main>

<div class="delete-modal" id="deleteModal">

    <div class="modal-box">

        <h3>기록을 삭제할까요?</h3>

        <p>삭제한 독서 기록은 다시 되돌릴 수 없습니다.</p>

        <div class="modal-buttons">

            <button class="cancel-btn" id="cancelDelete">취소</button>

            <button class="real-delete-btn" id="realDelete">삭제하기</button>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>

<script src="/js/detail.js"></script>

</body>

</html>